<header class="hero">
  <div>
    <div class="badge">Kattankulathur • Chennai</div>
    <h1>More Than a Campus.<br>A Place to Grow.</h1>
    <p>A student-friendly blog exploring SRM Institute of Science and Technology's Kattankulathur campus — its learning spaces, facilities, community and everyday campus experience.</p>
