  </div>
</header>

<section id="about">
  <div class="eyebrow">The Campus</div>
  <h2>Welcome to SRM Kattankulathur</h2>
  <p class="intro">SRMIST's flagship Kattankulathur campus is located about 15 km from Tambaram, Chennai. The campus brings together multiple academic faculties and a wide range of student facilities in one large university environment.</p>
  <div class="stats">
    <div class="stat"><b>1985</b>Campus roots at Kattankulathur</div>
    <div class="stat"><b>250+ acres</b>Large, green campus environment</div>
    <div class="stat"><b>12M sq ft</b>Approximate built-up area</div>
    <div class="stat"><b>95+ countries</b>Students from a global community</div>
  </div>
</section>


<section id="about-me">
  <div class="eyebrow">About Me</div>
  <div class="author-card">
    <div class="author-info">
      <h2>Sai Krishna.A</h2>
      <p class="author-course"><strong>B.E Cyber Security</strong></p>
      <p>SRM Valliammai Engineering College</p>
    </div>
    <div class="qr-wrap">
      <img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Instagram QR code">
      <span>Scan to<br>follow me on Instagram</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="highlights">
  <div class="eyebrow">Campus Highlights</div>
  <h2>What stands out?</h2>
  <p class="intro">A mix of academics, research, recreation and everyday conveniences makes the campus feel like a small university town.</p>
  <div class="grid">
    <article class="card"><div class="icon">🎓</div><h3>Multidisciplinary learning</h3><p>Engineering & Technology, Medicine & Health Sciences, Management, Science & Humanities and Law are represented at the Kattankulathur campus.</p></article>
    <article class="card"><div class="icon">📚</div><h3>Library & learning spaces</h3><p>The campus includes a Central Library along with smart classrooms, laboratories and spaces designed for study and collaboration.</p></article>
    <article class="card"><div class="icon">🏥</div><h3>Healthcare on campus</h3><p>The SRM Medical College Hospital and Research Centre is part of the Kattankulathur campus ecosystem.</p></article>
    <article class="card"><div class="icon">🏠</div><h3>Hostel life</h3><p>Separate residential facilities for men and women, plus an international hostel, support students who live on campus.</p></article>
    <article class="card"><div class="icon">🏊</div><h3>Sports & recreation</h3><p>Students can use sports arenas and recreational facilities, with campus life extending well beyond classrooms.</p></article>
    <article class="card"><div class="icon">🚌</div><h3>Getting around</h3><p>A free internal shuttle service helps students and faculty move around the sprawling campus.</p></article>
  </div>
</section>


<section id="gallery">
  <div class="eyebrow">Campus Gallery</div>
  <h2>Explore SRM Kattankulathur</h2>
  <p class="intro">A few views of the campus and its facilities.</p>
  <div class="photo-grid">
    <figure class="photo-card">
      <img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="SRM Valliammai Engineering College building">
